# Genkei Capital research-desk — env template.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values. `.env` is gitignored;
# never commit secrets. CI reads each variable from a same-named GitHub
# Actions secret instead.
#
# To load these into your shell during local dev:
#   - source the file:        set -a; source .env; set +a
#   - or use direnv:           cp .env .envrc + `direnv allow`
#   - or call from Python:     genkei.common.load_env_file()
#
# See README "Setup" section for the full pattern.

# ============================================================
# Required
# ============================================================

# Postgres connection (see docs/infrastructure.md). The driver prefix
# `postgresql+psycopg://` is stripped automatically by genkei.common.db.
GENKEI_DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg://<user>:<password>@<beelink-host>:5440/<db>

# FRED API key — free, instant registration at:
#   https://fredaccount.stlouisfed.org/apikeys
# Required by genkei.ingest.fred; the value is stripped from URLs before
# they land in meta.raw_blobs (see G-015).
FRED_API_KEY=

# SEC EDGAR User-Agent — SEC requires identification on every request to
# data.sec.gov (G-022). Set to your real name + a contact email; SEC
# may rate-limit or reject placeholder strings. No API key needed; SEC
# EDGAR is open-access. Format: "Your Name your.email@example.com"
SEC_USER_AGENT=

# CoinGecko demo API key — required by genkei.ingest.coingecko. Free,
# instant signup at https://www.coingecko.com/en/api/pricing (Demo tier).
# Demo chart history is limited to the past 365 days (G-025). Sent via
# x-cg-demo-api-key header, so it stays out of the URL.
COINGECKO_API_KEY=

# ============================================================
# Optional / forthcoming
# ============================================================
# API keys for ingesters that aren't built yet. Uncomment and fill in
# when the corresponding ingester lands.

# BEA — https://apps.bea.gov/API/signup/
# BEA_API_KEY=

# EIA — https://www.eia.gov/opendata/register.php
# EIA_API_KEY=

# (CoinGecko: moved to required block above. Pro tier full-history support
#  needs the pro-api host and x-cg-pro-api-key header when/if we pay.)
